1
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:08,500
Start with a leek, chopped fine.

2
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:12,000
Then an onion, sliced thin.

3
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:16,500
Green pepper goes into the hot pan first.

4
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:20,000
Now the onion joins it.

5
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:24,500
Cook slowly until it is soft and sweet.

6
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:27,500
Set it aside on a plate.

7
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:32,500
Pour in the cream and let it warm up gently.

8
00:00:33,300 --> 00:00:37,500
Stir in the blue cheese until it melts away.

9
00:00:38,300 --> 00:00:42,500
Meanwhile, boil the
gnocchi for just a minute.

10
00:00:43,300 --> 00:00:47,500
Bring the soft veg back
into the creamy sauce.

11
00:00:48,300 --> 00:00:51,500
Tip the cherry tomatoes into the sauce.

12
00:00:52,300 --> 00:00:54,500
Drain the gnocchi well.

13
00:00:55,300 --> 00:00:59,500
Add the gnocchi to the sauce
and mix it all together.

14
00:01:00,300 --> 00:01:03,000
Give it a good stir.

15
00:01:03,800 --> 00:01:08,000
Plate it up while it is nice and hot.

16
00:01:08,800 --> 00:01:12,000
Finish with plenty of grated Gruyère.

17
00:01:12,800 --> 00:01:17,000
And that's it. Creamy,
cosy and ready to eat.
